{
  "s6d11": {
    "intro": [
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_1.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "くしゅん！"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "（ぶるっ）はぁ…。この時期の山はちょっと冷える…。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "（それにしても、守り人の山に来るのは子どもの頃以来かも。）"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "（あの頃はこんなふうに飛べなかったし、ヘトヘトになりながら登ったっけ。）"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_3.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "（ん、こんな場所にも魔物が…？昔来たときは魔物なんていなかったのに…！）"
      }
    ],
    "battle_conversation": [
      {
        "speaker_name": "？？？",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "くそっ、前に来たときより結界が強くなってるのだ…。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "？？？",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "より強い魔力があればこんな結界なんて…。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "（なにやってるんだろ？あの魔物…。）"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "？？？",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "むっ、誰かそこにいるのか！？"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_1.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "（やば、気づかれた。）"
      }
    ],
    "battle_conversation2": [
      {
        "speaker_name": "？？？",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_devil_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "貴様、誰なのだ？ワガハイは援軍を呼んだ覚えなどないのだ。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "？？？",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_devil_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "まあ丁度良いのだ。貴様、そこの結界を破壊するのだ！"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_devil_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "ちょっと待ってよ。援軍？なんのことか全然分かんないんだけど。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_devil_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "それに結界を壊すって、そんなのろくな事にならないでしょ！"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "？？？",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_devil_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "むっ、違うのか？"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "？？？",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_devil_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "待て、なんなのだ貴様のその魔力…？"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "？？？",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_devil_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "…なるほど、あの鳥頭も我輩を止めるために魔族に頼るとは、"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "？？？",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_devil_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "もはやなりふり構っていられなくなったようなのだ。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_3.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_devil_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "はぁ？あたしが魔族なわけ無いでしょ。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_devil_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "ちょっと人より魔力が多いくらいで、魔族呼ばわりは心外なんだけど？"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "魔族",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_devil_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "ふん、他の有象無象は誤魔化せても、我輩の目は誤魔化せないのだ！"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "魔族",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_devil_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "まあ良い、大人しくその魔力を寄越してくれればここは見逃してやるのだ！"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_devil_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "はいどうぞって渡せるわけないでしょ？"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "魔族",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_devil_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "ふん、我輩に楯突くとは怖いもの知らずなのだ。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "魔族",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_devil_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "それなら、力ずくでも奪い取ってやるのだー！"
      }
    ],
    "battle_progression": [
      {
        "speaker_name": "魔族",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_devil_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "お前もあのギルドの差し金ってところだろうが、"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "魔族",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_devil_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "たった1人で来るなんて我輩も舐められたものなのだ。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_devil_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "文句ならうちのギルドマスターに言ってよね。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_devil_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "あのジジイ、面倒な仕事を押し付けてくれちゃってさ…。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "魔族",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_devil_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "あの鳥頭、またもこうして我輩の邪魔をするつもりなのだ…？"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_devil_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "またも…？"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "魔族",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_devil_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "ええい！こうなったら我輩の魔法で焼き払ってくれるのだ！！"
      }
    ],
    "resolution": [
      {
        "speaker_name": "魔族",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_devil_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "くぅ…。まさかこれほどとは…！"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_devil_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "（魔族って聞いて少し身構えてたけど、意外とあっさり終わった…？）"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_1.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_devil_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "（あのジジイがあたし1人で十分って判断した理由が分かった気がする…。）"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_devil_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "あのジジイには追い払えとしか言われてないし、"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_devil_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "今すぐどっか行って、二度とこの場所に近づかないでくれたほうがあたしも楽なんだけど。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "魔族",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_devil_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "わ、我輩をそうやって見下すななのだぁ！！"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "魔族",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_devil_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "…しかし、我輩も幾度となく敗北を経験して学んだことがあるのだ。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_devil_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "…？"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "魔族",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_devil_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "ふっ戦いに夢中で気づかなかったのだ？この結界を見るのだ！！"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_3.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_devil_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "…まさか！？"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "魔族",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_3.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_devil_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "そうなのだ！我輩は戦っていると見せかけて、貴様の力を利用させてもらったのだ！"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "魔族",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_3.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_devil_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "貴様はもう少し力の制御を覚えたほうが良いみたいなのだ！"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_3.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_devil_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "（しまった！あいつの目的はあたしを倒すことじゃなかった！）"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_1.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_devil_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "（あたしの攻撃を結界にぶつけて破壊させることだったの…！？）"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "魔族",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_devil_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "これだけ脆くなれば、ちょっと小突いてやれば簡単に破ることができるのだ！"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "魔族",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_devil_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "こんなふうに、なのだ！！"
      }
    ],
    "resolution2": [
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_devil_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "結界が…！"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "魔族",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_devil_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "ふっふっふー！貴様は戦力では勝っていたみたいだが、戦略は我輩の方が上だったのだ！"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "魔族",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_devil_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "そして我輩は山頂へ向かい、貴様をも凌ぐ強大な戦力をも手に入れてやるのだ！！"
      }
    ],
    "resolution3": [
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_3.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "（まずい、あいつ山頂に向かう気だ！）"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_3.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "（このままだと手が付けられなくなるかも…！）"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_3.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "……急がなきゃっ！"
      }
    ]
  },
  "s6d12": {
    "intro": [
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_1.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "くしゅん！"
      }
    ],
    "battle_conversation": [
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": null,
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "…。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "魔族",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_devil_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "ふっふっふ…。力が溢れてくるのだ…！"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "魔族",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_devil_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "貴様は一足遅かったのだ！我輩はこの山に秘められた力を手に入れたのだ！"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "フェリス",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_devil_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "left",
        "box_direction": "left",
        "text": "大人しく帰れって言っても、もう遅いよね。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "魔族",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_devil_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "ふんっ初めから尻尾巻いて逃げる気などさらさら無いのだ。"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "魔族",
        "face_left": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_face_0.png",
        "face_right": "res://assets/gfx/sprites/felis_devil_0.png",
        "speaker_side": "right",
        "box_direction": "right",
        "text": "丁度良い。貴様にはこの力を試す実験台になってもらうのだ！"
      },
      {
        "speaker_name": "魔族",
